 0030   0006    '----- shared compose buffer: one watcher rect at a time. MUST 
                hold the
 0030   0006    '----- LARGEST rect (currently north: 16 bytes x 31 rows = 496)
                 -- an
 0030   0006    '----- undersized buffer overruns into the state arrays declare
                d below
